     "body": "<p>Just wondering where this work went. I think I no longer need it but am trying to understand how one would use ldp:isMemberOfRelation.</p>\n\n<p>I thought like this (<a href=\"https://gist.github.com/whikloj/910aab49cf814c30316dbfd7dae41bf7\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://gist.github.com/whikloj/910aab49cf814c30316dbfd7dae41bf7</a>) but that isn't correct.</p>",
