  "description": "<p>This task is to resolve the situation when an IndirectContainer uses the inverted pattern of \"ldp:isMemberOfRelation\" to establish a relationship between an indirect resource and a membership resource.</p>\n\n<p>The issue is demonstrated by the following script:<br/>\n<a href=\"https://gist.github.com/awoods/2f790d6b0e089ef04a352d87dfd7cc3c\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://gist.github.com/awoods/2f790d6b0e089ef04a352d87dfd7cc3c</a></p>\n\n<p>..replacing line:22 \"MAX=10000\" with a smaller number, like \"MAX=5\".<br/>\n<a href=\"https://gist.github.com/awoods/2f790d6b0e089ef04a352d87dfd7cc3c#file-10k-membersof-sh-L22\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://gist.github.com/awoods/2f790d6b0e089ef04a352d87dfd7cc3c#file-10k-membersof-sh-L22</a></p>",
